story of venous \nthromboembolism, hypertension, migraines with aura) need to be considered. It may take 3 to 6 \nmonths for the OCP to reach optimal efficacy. There is minimal evidence for different forms of \nOCPs over each other for acne. Here are some examples available in Australia (all non-PBS):", "type": "Document"}}